  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="27.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 27.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif he ladian wille, geladige be dæde mæðe, swa mid þryfealdre [swa mid anfealdre], be þam þe seo dǽd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he seeks to clear himself, he shall do so in proportion to the deed, either by the triple mode of proof, [or by the simple], in accordance with the nature of the deed.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
